WEBVTT

00:00:28.133 --> 00:00:30.712
And four years later,

00:00:30.736 --> 00:00:34.976
it's been downloaded four million times.

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:38.712
So I suppose you could multiply that
by 20 or something

00:00:38.736 --> 00:00:40.784
to get the number
of people who've seen it.

00:00:40.808 --> 00:00:44.912
And, as Chris says, there is
a hunger for videos of me.

00:00:45.365 --> 00:00:48.009
(Laughter)

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:51.033
(Applause)

00:00:54.076 --> 00:00:55.078
Don't you feel?

00:00:55.102 --> 00:00:58.020
(Laughter)

00:00:59.857 --> 00:01:03.601
So, this whole event
has been an elaborate build-up